  "description": "Ubar RI SAOG (RIUH) is the tradable rights issue security listed on the MSX Rights_Issue Market (25.00 million rights shares at an OMR 0.102 issue price for an OMR 2.55 million capital raise, established 3 November 2026 with allotment approved 18 November 2026) issued by Ubar Hotels and Resorts SAOG (UBAR). The underlying operating issuer, Ubar Hotels and Resorts SAOG (founded 1994, majority-owned by Mohammed Al Barwani Investment LLC), owns and operates the Golden Tulip Hotel Nizwa, operates the Golden Tulip Hotel Muscat through wholly owned subsidiary Al Ahlam Hotel Management LLC, and disclosed the acquisition of Masirah Diamond Wave Hotel in October 2026. In 9M 2026, the underlying hospitality group reported OMR 1.60 million in consolidated revenue (-18% YoY) and a net operating loss of OMR 976,138 amid regional geopolitical travel headwinds, with rights proceeds supporting capital strength and portfolio expansion.",
